        "title": "IT’S NOT JUST THE HABIT. IT’S THE RITUAL.",
        "liquid": "<style>\n\n\n  .grid-column {\n    padding: 0rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n\n\n\n  .grid-column p {\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .two-column-grid {\n     \n      gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"two-column-grid\">\n  <div class=\"grid-column\">\n    \n    <p>You've tried stopping before. The patches didn't work. The gum didn't work. Because they never replaced this — the reach for it, the pause, the exhale. That's the ritual. And that's exactly what Brisa is built for.\n</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"max-width: 100% !important; background-image: url();background-position: right center; background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; \">\n<img src=\"//brisabetter.com/cdn/shop/files/sq-7.jpg?v=4399890867302413098\">\n    \n  </div>\n</div>",
